.TH SCENARIO 1 "2026-11-08" "holyc" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
scenario \- keyboard and mouse macro recorder and player
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B scenario record
[\fINAME\fR] [\fIDEVICE\fR...]
.br
.B scenario stop
.br
.B scenario play
[\fB\-s\fR \fIFACTOR\fR] [\fB\-n\fR \fITIMES\fR] \fINAME\fR
.br
.B scenario list
|
.B delete
\fINAME\fR |
.B rename
\fIOLD NEW\fR |
.B show
\fINAME\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
Records input events from evdev devices (default: every keyboard and mouse) and replays them through a virtual uinput device.
Needs root and re-runs itself through sudo when it is not root.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-s \fIFACTOR\fR
playback speed, 2 is twice as fast
.TP
.B \-n \fITIMES\fR
repeat count, 0 means until Ctrl\-C
.SH FILES
.I $XDG_DATA_HOME/scenario/NAME.N.evemu
(default ~/.local/share/scenario), one file per device, in the text format of evemu.
.SH WARNING
A recording of a keyboard contains every key typed, passwords included. Delete such recordings.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR shot (1)
